{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202648STrgfNGe1795092215.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>全國老齡工作會議召開，中共總書記習近平指示，要深入實施積極應對人口老齡化國家戰略，讓老年人生活更加幸福美滿。</p><p></p><p>會議周三起一連兩日在北京召開，會上傳達習近平指示指，指國家老齡工作取得新進展新成效，養老事業、養老產業快速發展，老年人獲得感、幸福感、安全感持續增強。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.ELDERLY-2000.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BSDbjJWf8s1795092633.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>強調要深入實施積極應對人口老齡化國家戰略，堅持政府、市場、社會、家庭協同發力，加強老年人社會保障、養老服務、健康服務、社會參與，大力發展銀髮經濟，營造孝老敬老良好環境，建設老年友好社會，努力讓老年人生活更加幸福美滿。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T12:57:35.770689+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":239,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T08:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T13:17:18.841373+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T12:50:54.726515+00:00","content_hash":"3bba7f428e97250424aa0be6afe65a7d8e15b42046a617cadc21a3f4733689a1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T12:57:35.770689+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}